WEBVTT

00:16.182 --> 00:18.643
Incompetence!

00:19.144 --> 00:24.524
Who the hell is creating such
filthy sounds with my orchestra?

00:25.984 --> 00:29.487
It's not us, so let's go home.

00:29.571 --> 00:31.740
Right.

00:31.823 --> 00:33.158
It's these guys!

00:36.703 --> 00:37.954
It's these guys!

00:38.747 --> 00:40.665
So it's you!

00:43.501 --> 00:45.378
What was that attack just now?

00:45.462 --> 00:46.755
What a bummer...

01:14.282 --> 01:15.742
Takakura-sama?

01:18.661 --> 01:19.913
You dumbass!

01:19.996 --> 01:21.623
Gotta dodge 'em properly!

01:21.706 --> 01:23.750
Those music notes are bombs!

01:24.250 --> 01:26.795
Especially the rest symbols.
Don't get caught by them.

01:26.878 --> 01:29.172
They'll literally make you rest in place.

01:29.756 --> 01:31.591
You say dodge them...

01:32.300 --> 01:36.596
But how do we actually
dodge this bullet hell?

03:08.062 --> 03:12.483
Symphony No. Six. Pastoral, damn it!

03:17.322 --> 03:18.615
It's a rice paddy!

03:18.698 --> 03:20.199
I wanna go home...

03:20.283 --> 03:22.994
Focus! The notes
are gonna come flying at us!

03:23.077 --> 03:25.663
It's not a rice paddy!

03:25.747 --> 03:27.999
Die, you damn pigs!

03:28.082 --> 03:29.709
Bullet hell incoming!

03:34.505 --> 03:35.465
Hold on.

03:35.548 --> 03:37.592
My feet are getting stuck
so I can't run well!

03:38.218 --> 03:39.260
What a bummer.

03:40.386 --> 03:41.804
Incompetence!

03:42.680 --> 03:44.891
Now die, damn it!

03:44.974 --> 03:49.354
Choo, choo. Train entering platform six.

03:49.437 --> 03:51.356
Poop!

03:51.439 --> 03:54.943
Father!

03:55.026 --> 03:59.239
Don't just talk about dads!
I'm amazing, too!

03:59.322 --> 04:00.782
Too slow!

04:00.865 --> 04:02.533
Needs a bigger whoosh!

04:02.617 --> 04:05.995
Increase the tempo!

04:14.504 --> 04:15.713
Die!

04:16.381 --> 04:18.758
Die!

04:18.841 --> 04:21.886
Aira-chan is awesome!
She's dodging all of them!

04:21.970 --> 04:26.474
No time to admire!
You need to dodge like that, too!

04:27.225 --> 04:28.059
Yow.

04:28.851 --> 04:30.311
My voice is weird!

04:30.395 --> 04:32.355
Such a nuisance!

04:35.942 --> 04:37.151
There's no opening!

04:41.155 --> 04:44.450
Die!

04:44.534 --> 04:46.411
Die, damn it!

04:50.790 --> 04:52.625
I-I can't move.

04:53.126 --> 04:54.377
You turd nugget!

04:54.460 --> 04:56.504
I just told you
to watch out for the rests!

04:59.924 --> 05:02.302
And, dead!

05:02.385 --> 05:03.761
Takakura-sama!

05:10.768 --> 05:14.647
Damn it, you cheater! Come down here!

05:21.321 --> 05:24.407
- You're just some nobody!
- Miss Shiratori is incredible.

05:24.490 --> 05:26.200
Die already, damn it!

05:26.284 --> 05:28.494
Just how spineless am I?

05:28.995 --> 05:31.080
I've fought so many powerful opponents,

05:31.164 --> 05:33.750
so I thought I got
at least a little bit stronger.

05:34.250 --> 05:38.087
But I haven't, at all.

05:39.589 --> 05:42.675
If you've got time to whine,
then move your spine!

05:42.759 --> 05:44.969
A sense of rhythm! Rhythm!

05:49.640 --> 05:51.851
It's gonna go on for a while yet.

05:51.934 --> 05:55.938
And we don't know how long
that skank can keep dodging.

05:56.022 --> 05:59.150
You don't need to understand
their performance.

05:59.233 --> 06:00.818
I don't care what it is.

06:00.902 --> 06:03.154
Just remember
any kind of music that you know!

06:03.237 --> 06:06.824
And use that rhythm to move your body!

06:07.366 --> 06:09.410
Easy for you to say.

06:09.494 --> 06:13.623
I don't listen to music at all,
so I don't know any songs.

06:19.378 --> 06:20.546
There is something.

06:20.630 --> 06:23.216
I listened to music just recently.

06:24.509 --> 06:26.385
I was so touched...

06:27.220 --> 06:29.097
and I got into the rhythm.

06:32.642 --> 06:35.478
Don't you be scurrying around,
you crappy nobody!

06:37.647 --> 06:39.524
What am I supposed to do?

06:39.607 --> 06:43.861
If I extend my hair, it'll hit
the notes and won't reach them!

07:01.963 --> 07:05.216
Looks like quite a bit of the field
has been tilled already.

07:06.926 --> 07:09.262
Thanks to all your running around!

07:10.471 --> 07:11.973
And, dead!

07:14.892 --> 07:18.396
Put some spirit into it, punk!

07:20.064 --> 07:21.691
Takakura-sama?

07:22.358 --> 07:24.402
Damn pipsqueak!

07:24.485 --> 07:26.863
Die!

07:29.574 --> 07:31.534
Die, damn it!

07:40.376 --> 07:44.297
Insatiate and wild
Roaming the land for a blood sacrifice

07:45.631 --> 07:49.260
Hell yeah! Good job, turd nugget!

07:49.343 --> 07:53.973
That pipsqueak's rhythm...
I hate it! Damn little bastard!

08:08.946 --> 08:10.448
Oh, dear.

08:11.657 --> 08:14.160
It's time for the party!

08:26.339 --> 08:28.090
Hey, hurry up and finish 'em off!

08:28.174 --> 08:31.761
Do not give me orders,
you crap vomit furball!

08:31.844 --> 08:32.720
Damn you!

08:32.803 --> 08:36.432
Don't you dare talk back to me,
you petty small fry!

08:36.516 --> 08:37.433
What a bummer...

09:23.145 --> 09:24.605
It's useless!

09:24.689 --> 09:27.316
Your sound bullet hell won't work anymore!

09:28.359 --> 09:30.987
Incompetence!

09:33.531 --> 09:37.994
You guys have angered me!

09:38.578 --> 09:40.663
I'll make sure to kill you!

09:41.205 --> 09:43.666
Symphony No. Nine!

09:43.749 --> 09:45.501
Choir ensemble!

11:37.154 --> 11:38.697
What the hell are they?

11:38.781 --> 11:42.076
They're illusions! Don't bother with them!

11:42.159 --> 11:43.828
Slam the musicians!

11:43.911 --> 11:46.205
Yes, but where are they?

11:55.548 --> 11:58.592
On top of the stage behind that giant!

11:59.427 --> 12:01.804
Hey, get your dirty hands off me!

12:02.388 --> 12:04.932
I can't move around at all.

12:05.015 --> 12:07.518
If you don't hurry up,
you'll be crushed to death!

12:08.102 --> 12:10.229
Takakura-sama, your hand!

12:53.230 --> 12:54.356
Aira-chan!

12:54.440 --> 12:57.526
Leave these guys to me! Get the musicians!

15:17.041 --> 15:20.169
Hurry! Otherwise
you'll be surrounded again!

15:20.252 --> 15:21.211
I know!

15:24.506 --> 15:26.425
But I can only go full throttle twice.

15:26.508 --> 15:28.886
One blast per person won't cut it!

15:31.305 --> 15:33.474
Five switches per beat.

15:35.017 --> 15:36.894
It'd be a piece of cake for me.

15:42.399 --> 15:44.151
So that's what you mean!

15:57.039 --> 16:00.292
Stop it!

16:42.876 --> 16:44.420
Did we defeat them?

16:46.797 --> 16:48.173
Miss Shiratori.

16:48.716 --> 16:50.092
Are you all right?

16:50.801 --> 16:53.554
Yeah, I'm fine.

16:54.096 --> 16:57.391
I was somehow able
to defeat it thanks to you.

16:58.684 --> 17:00.394
Thank you so much!

17:02.938 --> 17:04.023
Huh?

17:04.106 --> 17:08.652
That's not the case!
You were super impressive, too!

17:10.237 --> 17:13.824
My normal self... Come out already...

17:21.123 --> 17:25.878
It was all thanks to my lecture.
You two should feel appreciative!

17:27.087 --> 17:30.883
Oh, you were around?
Such a trashy presence.

17:30.966 --> 17:34.970
Head outside! Your "goodbye"
is already set in stone.

17:35.554 --> 17:37.056
Thanks to Turbo Granny,

17:37.139 --> 17:40.225
I think I understand
what this sense of rhythm is.

17:40.309 --> 17:41.143
Thank you.

17:41.226 --> 17:43.562
Heh, don't get cocky!

17:43.645 --> 17:48.400
What you understand now
is only worth earwax!

17:48.984 --> 17:51.945
My power is nothing compared to this.

17:54.114 --> 17:57.493
So what were those guys, anyway?

17:58.077 --> 18:00.162
Just some thoughts given form.

18:00.245 --> 18:07.169
The collective fear of the portraits
in the music room simply took shape.

18:07.252 --> 18:10.964
If you play the piano at 2:00 a.m.
they'll show up again.

18:11.048 --> 18:13.634
If they kill you,
you'll also die in real life, though.

18:14.218 --> 18:16.053
Never again!

18:16.136 --> 18:19.890
More like, how do you know
about the apparitions in this school?

18:19.973 --> 18:22.226
You aren't up to something, are you?

18:22.309 --> 18:26.188
I'm always thinking about how to kill you...

18:26.814 --> 18:27.648
guys...

18:29.274 --> 18:30.359
off.

18:37.574 --> 18:40.410
Let's call the HAYASii band once more!

18:40.494 --> 18:43.831
Evil Eye is definitely
doing something to counter us.

18:44.331 --> 18:46.208
We can't hold out any longer.

18:46.834 --> 18:48.085
I don't want to think about it...

18:49.086 --> 18:50.754
but someone will die.

18:55.592 --> 19:00.305
Mr. Jiji, you don't want to kill
Ms. Seiko or Miss Momo, right?

19:00.389 --> 19:04.351
At this rate, you won't be able
to live with your parents, either.

19:06.311 --> 19:09.106
We will perform the exorcism tomorrow.

19:11.191 --> 19:14.736
I've already asked HAYASii to come back.

19:14.820 --> 19:16.363
Hold on a sec!

19:16.446 --> 19:18.198
Don't move things along on your own!

19:18.282 --> 19:20.742
I will be giving the ritual prayers.

19:24.496 --> 19:26.415
Grandma, say something!

19:26.498 --> 19:28.584
You said you were gonna make him family!

19:28.667 --> 19:31.837
Jiji's been training
his spiritual power, too!

19:31.920 --> 19:34.047
Come on, right, Grandma?

19:36.884 --> 19:40.053
Jin Enjoji! Step outside!

19:40.679 --> 19:42.598
Huh? Okarun?

20:02.117 --> 20:03.952
Okarun, what's going on?

20:04.036 --> 20:07.831
More like, where have
you two been this late at night?

20:08.457 --> 20:10.417
Miss Shiratori, the water, please.

20:10.500 --> 20:11.376
Okay!

20:12.878 --> 20:15.422
Hey, what are you planning to do?

20:15.505 --> 20:17.883
Nobody meddle in this, please!

20:17.966 --> 20:21.511
I will now give Evil Eye
the beating of his afterlife!

20:22.137 --> 20:24.223
Come on, Okarun, I'm really gonna get mad.

20:24.306 --> 20:25.974
This isn't a game, okay?

20:27.935 --> 20:32.731
I was pissed when Evil Eye assaulted you.

20:34.233 --> 20:36.068
I was really pissed off!

20:37.152 --> 20:39.738
For a while, I thought
we'd somehow get through this.

20:39.821 --> 20:42.032
But Evil Eye really is dangerous!

20:42.115 --> 20:45.994
He's savage and cunning
and not someone we can ignore.

20:46.078 --> 20:50.457
But Miss Ayase, you guys
are trying to accept Evil Eye.

20:50.540 --> 20:52.751
That's really absurd.

20:53.835 --> 20:55.671
And that's really...

20:56.630 --> 20:58.548
badass!

20:59.675 --> 21:03.929
So I'm pissed off at my own weakness.

21:04.012 --> 21:09.017
Just you wait, Jiji.
Your will to protect Evil Eye...

21:09.977 --> 21:11.853
I'll make sure to protect it!

21:13.397 --> 21:15.774
Mr. Takakura, please calm down.

21:15.857 --> 21:18.819
We've already decided
that Mr. Jiji will be exorcised!

21:18.902 --> 21:21.488
There's no need to fight against Evil Eye!

21:21.571 --> 21:22.739
Manjiro!

21:24.866 --> 21:27.160
The guy has fire in his words.

21:28.036 --> 21:30.539
- Don't embarrass him.
- What?

21:31.623 --> 21:32.833
Takakura!

21:33.583 --> 21:35.210
Here we go!

21:35.794 --> 21:37.462
Momo-chan, stand aside.

21:44.845 --> 21:47.180
Okarun, I'm trusting you with Evil Eye!

21:47.806 --> 21:48.849
Yeah.

23:38.875 --> 23:40.418
Don't underestimate me!

23:40.502 --> 23:42.754
I can kill you guys off
at any point in time.

23:42.838 --> 23:44.756
Like, pulverize you
into smithereens like this house.

23:44.840 --> 23:48.218
Hey, you're hungry, right?
Eat that until dinner is ready.

23:48.301 --> 23:49.177
Hurray!

23:49.261 --> 23:50.971
Next episode,
"I Want to Rebuild the House."

23:51.054 --> 23:52.472
You're gonna help, too.
